& =\frac{1}{2} \frac{2}{5} \omega r^2 d^2\left(\because I_{\text {Solid sphere }}=\frac{2}{5} m r^2\right) \\
& K \cdot E_{\text {translational }}=\frac{1}{2} m v^2 \\
& \therefore \frac{K \cdot E_{\text {rotational }}}{K \cdot E_{\text {translational }}}=\frac{2}{5}
\end{aligned}

